{"id":102,"verses":[{"number":1,"arabicText":"أَلْهَىٰكُمُ ٱلتَّكَاثُرُ","transliteration":"Alhākumu t-takāthur","translation":"Competition in [worldly] increase diverts you"},{"number":2,"arabicText":"حَتَّىٰ زُرْتُمُ ٱلْمَقَابِرَ","transliteration":"Ḥattā zur'tumu l-maqābir","translation":"Until you visit the graveyards."},{"number":3,"arabicText":"كَلَّا سَوْفَ تَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"Kallā sawfa taʿlamūn","translation":"No! You are going to know."},{"number":4,"arabicText":"ثُمَّ كَلَّا سَوْفَ تَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"Thumma kallā sawfa taʿlamūn","translation":"Then no! You are going to know."},{"number":5,"arabicText":"كَلَّا لَوْ تَعْلَمُونَ عِلْمَ ٱلْيَقِينِ","transliteration":"Kallā law taʿlamūna ʿil'ma l-yaqīn","translation":"No! If you only knew with knowledge of certainty..."},{"number":6,"arabicText":"لَتَرَوُنَّ ٱلْجَحِيمَ","transliteration":"Latarawunna l-jaḥīm","translation":"You will surely see the Hellfire."},{"number":7,"arabicText":"ثُمَّ لَتَرَوُنَّهَا عَيْنَ ٱلْيَقِينِ","transliteration":"Thumma latarawunnahā ʿayna l-yaqīn","translation":"Then you will surely see it with the eye of certainty."},{"number":8,"arabicText":"ثُمَّ لَتُسْـَٔلُنَّ يَوْمَئِذٍ عَنِ ٱلنَّعِيمِ","transliteration":"Thumma latus'alunna yawma-idhin ʿani n-naʿīm","translation":"Then you will surely be asked that Day about pleasure."}]}